# Gateway pipeline

After HTTPS/CORS/error middleware:

`UseRouting` → `UseWebSockets` → `UseCurrentUser` → `UseGateway` → `MapGatewayEndpoints` → `MapReverseProxy`.

```csharp
app.UseRouting();
app.UseWebSockets();
app.UseCurrentUser();
app.UseGateway();

app.MapGatewayEndpoints(new GatewayEndpointOptions
{
    EnableNitro = enableNitro,
    NitroTitle = nitroTitle,
});

app.MapReverseProxy();
```
